1. She previously worked as a developer. (Verbatim: "for a case where it can be okay is like um when someone only wants you at your best and can never and never wants you when you're not at your best you know that's that's not okay either you know like yeah i feel like it's kind of that's kind of the other perspective of it you know like if someone's always giving you their best you should also be able to accept their worst or you should hope you should try to accept them at their worst and when they say when they're at their worst we don't mean in a toxic like when they're really mean to you i think it's more like when someone's in a really bad state like if someone's in a really like down moment because people can't always stay on their state stay you know happy happy happy um you know and accept them when they're down so i think i think the root of this of the original motivational quote is good but i feel like it's been used so much that it's become toxic um yeah so yeah it's it's it's basically how it's it's it's been used has unfortunately changed its meaning um but no this one's great if you can't handle me at my worst that's also my best like you'll be like sometimes sometimes when someone's doing really awful okay they're not trying to be awful in terms of like bad at something they are doing their best so yeah keep that in mind yo um and um yeah like")
